    "reviews": "\u201cThe world design is excellent, the story feels fresh and a lot of thought has obviously gone into it\u2019s tactical card game \u2013 it\u2019s easy to learn, fun to play, and a perfect substitute for traditional RPG combat.  A Full House.\u201d<br>Alpha Beta Gamer<br><br>\u201cWhen you give me the option to be the story and influence the game world around me, you are onto a good thing, in my book! I can\u2019t be the only one thinking this, as many gamers (not just card gamers) crave this level of game and story interaction.\u201d<br>Trading Card Games<br><br>\u201cA fast-paced card game with an exciting story to match? What more could you want!\u201d<br>Nerd Stash<br>",
